OL,3,GNEWSAShop staff key to reducing knife
OL,4,Acrime, says owner
OL,5,
OL,6,FShop owner Tim Roberts, whose staff
OL,7,Fpassed the test, said: "The
OL,8,Fconsequences of knife crime are
OL,9,Fabsolutely horrendous so we need to
OL,10,Fplay our part as retailers... to try
OL,11,Fand keep this area safe and as low in
OL,12,Fknife crime as we possibly can."
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
